    "english": {
      "headingRaw": "Five-character-regular-verseDuFuONTHEGATE-TOWERATYOUZHOU",
      "translationRaw": "IhadalwaysheardofLakeDongting--AndnowatlastIhaveclimbedtothistower。WithWucountrytotheeastofmeandChutothesouth，Icanseeheavenandearthendlesslyfloating。。。。Butnowordhasreachedmefromkinorfriends。Iamoldandsickandalonewithmyboat。Northofthiswalltherearewarsandmountains--AndherebytherailhowcanIhelpcrying？",
